# Graphify generated artifacts.
#
# These are deliberately NOT in .gitignore — graphify-out/ is committed so the
# repo carries a prebuilt knowledge graph. They are excluded here instead so
# Claude Code does not pull them into context: graph.json and the graphify-out/
# tree are rewritten on every `graphify update`, and a file that changes on
# every extract invalidates the prompt cache each session.
#
# Query the graph with `graphify query "..."` rather than reading these directly.
graph.json
graphify-out/

# HANDOFF.md is an archive (see docs/archive/): the migration-era session
# journal. 386 KB of prose that changes never — excluded from context for the
# same prompt-cache reason as the graph. docs/ENCYCLOPEDIA.md is the live doc.
docs/archive/
